    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d224">

                <pb facs="0511" n="483" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v14p1/pg483"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">961.53/6–2454: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 224<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Republic of China
                            (Rankin) to the
                            Department of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >secret<lb/>priority</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Taipei</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1954-06-24T15:00:00+09:00">June 24, 1954—3 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>711. Embtel 702.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d224-f1"
                    /> Two Chinese destroyer escorts at 8 a.m. local time June 23 stopped and
                    boarded Soviet tanker <hi rendition="#italic">Tuapse</hi> midway <pb facs="0512"
                        n="484" xml:id="pg484"/> between Luzon and Formosa. After tanker crew
                    sitdown strike of several hours vessel was brought into Kaohsiung 7 a.m. June
                    24.</p>
                <p>Second Soviet tanker <hi rendition="#italic">Leningrad</hi> identified off coast
                    Indochina following same course as <hi rendition="#italic">Tuapse</hi>.</p>
                <p>Chinese Navy awaiting arrival <hi rendition="#italic">Leningrad</hi> and expects
                    take over vessel late afternoon June 25.</p>
                <p>Chinese Foreign Minister Yeh informs me
                    he opposed any seizure Soviet vessels on high seas and his view had concurrence
                    Chief Staff General Chou Chi-jou.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Rankin</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
